  "body": "... since they're easier to read.\r\n\r\n```\r\nhttp://domain/dir name/?va r=va lue\r\n```\r\nshould parse as:\r\n```\r\nhttp://domain/dir%20name/?va+r=va+lue\r\n```\r\ninstead of:\r\n```\r\nhttp://domain/dir%20name/?va%20r=va%20lue\r\n```\r\nby default",
